        "TileImage": "$($repository 45c2230a-3bda-4779-aedf-c713fc7ad87b).Image",
        "Description": "Bad news, 47. The results from our client satisfaction survey have come back and the outcome was poor. It appears they&apos;ve grown tired of our usual methods and demand something a little more extravagant (i.e. completely unnecessary).\r\rTo that end, our next mission will see you head abroad to Sapienza. Broadly speaking, you will need to eliminate some bad guys doing bad stuff. But the important part is this... Act boldly, 47! It is time we broaden your horizons!\r\rGood luck!\r\rContract by Atarist89",
